<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Homemade Pancakes</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <h1>Homemade Pancakes</h1>

    <p>
      These fluffy homemade pancakes are quick to make and perfect for breakfast.
    </p>

    <img 
      src="https://cdn.freecodecamp.org/curriculum/labs/recipe.jpg" 
      alt="A stack of homemade pancakes on a plate"
    >

    <h2>Ingredients</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>1 cup flour</li>
      <li>1 egg</li>
      <li>1 cup milk</li>
      <li>2 tablespoons sugar</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Instructions</h2>

    <ol>
      <li>Mix the flour and sugar in a bowl.</li>
      <li>Add the egg and milk, then stir until smooth.</li>
      <li>Heat a pan over medium heat.</li>
      <li>Pour batter into the pan and cook until golden brown.</li>
    </ol>
  </body>
</html>